<item>
<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-10-31T07:11:02.080Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 07:11:02 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Pakistan Army has struck and destroyed Afghan Taliban border posts after Taliban mortar and small-arms fire hit northwest Pakistan, killing a civilian and wounding five. The Taliban’s attack prompted a Pakistani operation against illegal Afghans in Peshawar and a call for international responsibility for Afghan refugees, while a UN expert criticised the Taliban’s rights record. Pakistan also closed the Iran-Iraq land border for pilgrims, linking the move to rising LPG prices, and China and Pakistan opened a green trade channel at the Sost-Khunjerab crossing. The conflict has caused 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE53T0FLRTlXTG1GU2x5TTU3ekNGQ3JxZGxobHB3ZXNySlhiaEpNczBrc3RjRUVrQmNHanF5Vjk2SE1GTTc2NUNkZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTFBSam1ZZTdlR2JzRUVRU19aa1k4STdMX2FkTDNEaDZFaGpkdGZIaElZbTZSNGlHTS1WblRGdUM4WDJVakNYRGhxRw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxPVTZzT1BQbXgySkNOMjVjUmh0UUxZMW9KME42cTVDVDhRNzhVbnVuanJITkZoRGZqSkxUeDE4TmF5czByTnRTVkYyRkVZRWdQMjNuVF9FT3NBLXRQOHFscFRwc3NjLVdoSlM4X0pPaGJtUjBrdXdVZmdMSFBfX0Nqc3JhSHYxaXNQSzNhUm13LXJGV3M?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiT0FVX3lxTFB2Y2NkRXNoLWRFU3ZFWUZ1T21VNzdBX1ZJZjJLWlJTbk5mdFdsQzNKNmx0dFVPVFhscWZTOUpaS21LaUIwMFQ2SDgwNzV5VkE?oc=5&quot;&gt;thekabultribune.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxOTGdZZWZObXdYajJEOFEwS2dvcERqMnJDX09xMWhqMVlWc3RzbW1qYjVWTURQR2RjMmpXTWVfRHZkeFBycFJMUXlwUkMxMWp5R2ppVkE1TU50UWxlOU5LaF9MeGhKcDZ3cE1IUVpma2t2QURHcmhabFJCWHY5czlHbkxCalJacGszb